What is the goal of Wordle?
</summary>


<p>

The goal of Wordle is to find the hidden five-letter word within six guesses by using clues from each attempt.

</p>


</details>





<details>

<summary>
Is Wordle free to play?
</summary>


<p>

Yes, Wordle can be played free through the official game platform.

</p>


</details>





<details>

<summary>
What do green tiles mean in Wordle?
</summary>


<p>

A green tile means the letter is correct and appears in the correct position.

</p>


</details>





<details>

<summary>
Can Wordle words have repeated letters?
</summary>


<p>

Yes, some Wordle answers include repeated letters. Players should keep this possibility in mind while solving puzzles.

</p>


